            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno Solomon owacci,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Rwot otyeko wacci en ebibedo i pol macollicuc.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agerri doŋ ot ma ocudo malo, wek obed kabedoni ma ibedo iye matwal.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok kabaka olokke, ci olamo gum i kom lwak jo Icrael ma gucokke ducu, kun jo Icrael ma gucokke-ni gucuŋ mot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Cam 7.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tek 17.1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En ocako lamo gum ni, “Gipwo Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, ma doŋ cine otyeko cobo gin ma “am oloko ki doge bot wora Daudi-ni, kun wacci, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nia wa i kare ma akwanyo ki jona jo Icrael ki i Ejipt, peya ayero gaŋ mo ma i kaka ma i Icrael pi gero iye ot mo, wek nyina obed iye. Dok pe ayero laker mo me loyo jona jo Icrael; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento doŋ atyeko yero Jerucalem wek nyina obed kenyo, ka dok ayero Daudi me bedo lalo lwakka jo Icrael.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-nu onoŋo wora Daudi obedo ki tam i cwinye me gero ot pi nyiŋ Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Rwot aye owaco bot wora Daudi ni, ‘Kit macalo onoŋo doŋ tam tye i cwinyi me gero ot pi nyina, itimo ber pi keto lok meno i cwinyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento pe in aye dok ibigerra ot, ento wodi ma ibinywalo aye bigero ot pi nyiŋa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare-ni Rwot doŋ otyeko cobo gin ma en ociko i cikkene; pien an doŋ atyeko leyo ka tyen wora Daudi, doŋ atyeko bedo i wi komker pa Icrael, kit ma yam Rwot ociko-ni, dok atyeko gero ot pi nyiŋ Rwot Lubaŋa pa Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ atyeko keto iye kabedo pa canduk pa Rwot, ma tye iye gicikke ma Rwot con oketo ki jo Icrael.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon dok ocuŋ i nyim keno tyer pa Rwot ki i nyim lwak jo Icrael ma gucokke ducu, ocako taŋo ciŋe aryo ducu malo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomon onoŋo otiyo abam mola ma borre futi abiro ki nucu, ki acee futi abiro ki nucu, ki borre nia piny dok malo futi aŋwen ki nucu, ocibo i dyekal; en ocuŋ i wiye. Ka dok orumo coŋe piny i nyim lwak jo Icrael ducu ma gucokke, ka ocako taŋo ciŋe aryo ducu malo okemo polo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun wacci, “Ai Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, pe tye Lubaŋa mo macalo in, kadi malo i polo nyo piny i wi lobo, ma tye ka gwoko gicikkene macalo in, ma inyuto mar meri ma pe lokke bot luticci ma bedo ka lubi ki cwinygi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibedo ka lubo kit gin ma yam itito bot wora Daudi, iyo, gin ma yam iloko ki dogi, icako doŋ tiyo i kare man ki ciŋi, ci ico bo ducu maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Luker 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi ai Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, doŋ ilub gin ma yam iciko ki laticci wora Daudi, kun iwacci, ‘Pe ibibedo laboŋo danoni mo i nyima ma bibedo i wi komker pa Icrael, tekke awobeni gugwoko kitgi maber, kun gilubo cikka kit macalo ibedo kwede i nyimani.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai Rwot, Lubaŋa pa Icrael, kombeddi mi lokki doŋ omok matek, kit ma cen iloko ki wora Daudi ma laticci.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
