            "sid": "2CH 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ce polo ocegge woko, ma kot mo pe ocwer pi lakit balgi mo i komi, ka ce lwakki gucako lega kun gukemo kabedo man, kun gituco nyiŋi, ka guŋut ci gubwoto balgi, ki i kare ma iketo can i komgi-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci in Lubaŋa iwinygi ki i polo, iwek bal pa luticci, gin joni jo Icrael, dok ipwonygi ki yo maber ma myero gulubi; ci doŋ imi kot ocwer i loboni-ni ma yam imiyo bot lwakki obed megi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
