          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ce kec opoto i lobo, ka two gemo opoto, nyo ka bel obwarre nyo odoko ocone, nyo ka bonyo opoto nyo okwil obino, ka ce merokgi orumogi i gaŋigi mogo nyo kadi bed kit gemo aŋo, nyo kit two mo-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka ce lwakki gucako lega nyo bako doggi, kadi bed dano acel kok boti, nyo joni jo Icrael ducu, kun dano acel acel ŋeyo kit atwomme kene, ki cwercwinye bene, ka ce otaŋo ciŋe okemo ki ot man; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci in Lubaŋa iwinygi ki i polo ka ma ibedo iye-ni, iwek balgi. Tim dano acel acel kit ma iŋeyo kwede cwinye, ma rwatte ki kit kwone ducu, pien in aye, in keni, iŋeyo kit cwiny pa dano ducu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meno bimiyo gibedo ka lworo in kun gilubo yo meri nino ducu ma gibedo, iye i lobo ma yam imiyo bot kwarowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.31"
            ]
          }
        }
